<span class=\"bullet\">N'oubliez pas d'inclure :</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Une liste des activit\u00e9s qu'on peut faire dans les endroits que vous avez choisis</li> \n<li>Le titre de votre article. <span class=\"italic\">Exemple : La Provence, le paradis des sportifs</span></li></ul>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Quand vous avez fini, appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Allez \u00e0 l'exercice \u00e9crit</span>.</span> <br/><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Paragraphe :", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Vous avez fini !", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">R\u00e9visez votre paragraphe.</span><br/>Attention :<br/>  <ul><li>Pensez \u00e0 vos lecteurs.</li> <li>Choisissez des endroits que vous connaissez bien.</li> <li>Pensez \u00e0 un titre int\u00e9ressant.</li> <li>Faites des phrases compl\u00e8tes.</li></ul>Relisez-vous. Attention aux coquilles !<br/>Appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Soumettre</span> pour sauver votre travail.", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1